OL,3,GNEWSA'It was emotional playing cello
OL,4,Aagain after crash'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musician who was seriously injured in
OL,7,Fa crash has said that being able to
OL,8,Fplay her instrument again for just a
OL,9,Ffew minutes felt like "getting part of
OL,10,Fherself back".
OL,12,FClara Hope Simpson was traveling from
OL,13,FManchester to Sheffield for her first
OL,14,Fday in a teaching role at Sheffield
OL,15,FMusic Academy when the car in which she
OL,16,Fwas a passenger hit a large patch of
OL,17,Fice and flipped onto its roof.
OL,19,FThe incident, on A57 Snake Pass on 1
OL,20,FMarch, 2025, left the then 26-year-old
OL,21,Fin hospital for ten days with two
OL,22,Ffractured vertebrae.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
