OL,3,GNEWSA'It was emotional playing cello
OL,4,Aagain after crash'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 28-year-old said: "It was the most
OL,7,Fterrifying experience of my life. When
OL,8,FI was told I'd broken my neck, I
OL,9,Fgenuinely thought everything I'd worked
OL,10,Fso hard for was over."
